---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import config from "../../site.config.ts";
import { disclaimer } from "@uaeprop/site-kit";

const title = "Terms | Handover";
const description =
  "What Handover is, what it is not, and the limits of what you should rely on it for.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="shell py-12 md:py-16">
    <p class="label mb-4">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem)]">What this site is, and is not</h1>

    <div class="measure mt-10 space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.35rem]">We are not a broker</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">{disclaimer(config.brand)}</p>
        <p class="text-ink-2">
          Nothing on this site is an offer to sell property, an invitation to buy one, or
          an advertisement for any specific unit. We hold no Dubai Land Department
          advertising permit because we advertise nothing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.35rem]">This is information, not advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">
          The guide describes how transactions generally work. It is not legal, financial
          or tax advice, and it cannot account for your circumstances. Before you commit to
          a purchase, take advice from a qualified professional who knows your situation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.35rem]">Figures go out of date</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">
          Fees, thresholds and lending rules change, sometimes without notice. Every page
          carries the date its content was last reviewed. Treat every number here as
          indicative and confirm it with the Dubai Land Department, your lender or your
          conveyancer before you rely on it. We do not warrant that any figure is current.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.35rem]">Introductions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">
          If we introduce you to a licensed brokerage, that firm is independent of us. We
          do not supervise their advice, control their fees, or take responsibility for
          their conduct. Satisfy yourself about any firm before you instruct them &mdash;
          you can verify a brokerage and its agents with the Dubai Land Department
          directly. We may be paid a fee for the introduction.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.35rem]">Third-party names</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">
          Developers, banks, authorities and projects are referred to descriptively, to
          explain how the market works. Those names belong to their owners. Reference does
          not imply affiliation, endorsement, or any authority to act on their behalf.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.35rem]">Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">
          This guide is provided as it is. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable
          for loss arising from decisions taken on the basis of it. That is not a
          formality: property decisions are large, and this is a free guide written by
          people who are not acting for you.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
